---
title: Multimodal Artifact Reference and Image Editing
---
flowchart LR
    User([User message]) --> Choice{Artifact selected?}
    Choice -->|yes| Selected[Explicit image ID]
    Choice -->|no| Gate{DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>artifact modality gate}
    Gate -->|image required| Candidates[Owner-scoped pixel vectors<br/>then description vectors]
    Gate -->|none required| Ordinary[Continue without<br/>private artifact retrieval]
    Candidates --> Policy[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>referent resolution]
    Selected --> Guard[Ownership, readiness<br/>and lineage]
    Policy -->|one match| Guard
    Policy -->|ambiguous or absent| Clarify[Show matching images<br/>or ask for detail]

    Store[(Artifact metadata, descriptions,<br/>pixel and text vectors)] --> Candidates
    Store --> Guard
    Guard --> Action{Question or edit?}
    Action -->|question| Answer[Grounded chat answer]
    Action -->|edit| Edit[FLUX source edit]
    Edit --> Revision[Immutable child revision]
    Revision --> Store
    Revision --> UI[Replace visible parent;<br/>retain lineage]
    Answer --> UI
    Clarify --> UI

    Future[Planned sources: video, audio and<br/>parsed PDF/RAG chunks]
    Verify[Planned: verify requested changes<br/>and preserved content before promotion]
    Future -.-> Gate
    Edit -.-> Verify -.-> Revision

